[CONTRADICTED] A2
  claim     : moment(y0,C0) lands within a factor of 1-2 of R_full* on every cell (matched bank).
  source    : diagnosis_report.md 3.2
  recomputed: ratios over the 7 matched cells where R_full* is above the analytic ISE resolution floor: min 1.18, median 2.07, max 12034957.87; 4 of 7 cells exceed 2. In the 1 cells where R_full* is BELOW the resolution floor (8e-17..8e-17) the ratio is not a meaningful quantity at all.
